    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely Anime Puzzle: Valentine is a delightful puzzle game featuring charming anime-style girls in festive St.Valentine Day attire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to assemble images of these adorable characters, which have been divided into a set number of puzzle pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 4 difficulty levels that progressively increase the challenge and add new excitement. Regardless of the chosen difficulty, you\u2019ll enjoy high-quality artwork showcasing the vibrant holiday theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features of Lovely Anime Puzzle: Valentine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 50 engaging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Beautiful Valentine-themed artwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Intuitive mouse controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Achievements to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing background music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471440/extras/b067bc4f66921d6e2d15ed12109b7f06.poster.avif?t=1745433859\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471440/extras/b067bc4f66921d6e2d15ed12109b7f06.webm?t=1745433859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
